      "verified_at": "2026-11-24",
      "expires_at": "2027-11-15",
      "verbatim_quote": "When zero NIST SP 800-171 security requirements are implemented, subtracting the maximum 313-point deduction from 110 produces the minimum SPRS score of -203.",
